          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 780,
          "content": "A component contract explains what a component owns, what it receives, and what states it must expose. In product systems, the contract is the bridge between design decisions and implementation discipline.\n\nUse props for explicit variation, composition for layout flexibility, and state machines for interaction clarity.",
